"Codex is in API-key mode; live quota tracking is only available for ChatGPT subscriptions." = "Codex 处于 API key 模式；实时额度跟踪仅支持 ChatGPT 订阅。";
"Codex live-quota tracking follows the authoritative `~/.codex/auth.json` session directly and does not create a second Keychain copy. A legacy CodeBurn Keychain item, when present, is read only as a migration fallback. Only ChatGPT-mode auth (Plus / Pro / Team / Business / Edu / Enterprise) is supported. API-key users are billed per request and have a different reporting surface. Credit-metered workspaces report no rate-limit windows, so their monthly credit allowance is shown instead." = "Codex 实时额度跟踪直接读取权威的 `~/.codex/auth.json` 会话，不会在钥匙串中创建第二份副本。若存在旧版 CodeBurn 钥匙串条目，仅作为迁移回退读取。仅支持 ChatGPT 模式的登录（Plus / Pro / Team / Business / Edu / Enterprise）。API key 用户按请求计费，报表方式不同。按额度点数计量的工作区不会报告限流窗口，因此改为显示其每月额度点数。";
